        "original_id": "a51b4493-26de-5013-ba32-da3d4715dac8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Roberts\n- Films: Big Hero 6, Ferdinand\n- Companies: Disney, Blue Sky Studios, 20th Century Fox Animation\n- Awards: Academy Awards, Annie Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Roberts, born Bruce Robert Jordan on June 19, 1957, is an American screenwriter and film director.\n- Jordan Roberts co-wrote the screenplay for Disney's 2014 animated film Big Hero 6.\n- Big Hero 6 won the Academy Award, and Jordan Roberts was nominated for the Annie Award for Writing in a Feature Production for his work on it.\n- Jordan Roberts also co-wrote the screenplay for Ferdinand.\n- Ferdinand is an upcoming 2017 American 3D computer-animated comedy film produced by Blue Sky Studios and 20th Century Fox Animation.",
